-- all_nums.lille: every number case in one file
-- Expected: 5 lexical errors total, on the lines marked ERROR below.
-- Each valid number should print one Integer or Real token with the stated value.
--
-- integers: Integer 0, 42, 12345
0
42
12345
-- reals: Real 3.14, 0.5, 100.25
3.14
0.5
100.25
-- exponents: Integer 1E+5 (100000), Real 2.5e+3 (2500.0), Real 3.0E-2 (0.03)
1E+5
2.5e+3
3.0E-2
-- range: Integer 1, range symbol, Integer 10 (twice, second with spaces)
1..10
1 .. 10
-- range with identifier: Integer 3, range symbol, Identifier X
3..x
-- ERROR 1: period with no digit after it
3.
-- ERROR 2: period followed by a non-digit, then Identifier X should scan normally
3.x
-- ERROR 3: exponent marker with nothing after it
5E
-- ERROR 4: exponent sign with no digits
5E+
-- ERROR 5: negative exponent on an integer
7E-2
-- scanning must continue after the errors: Integer 99
99